# Prompts are Bria FIBO structured (VGL) JSON, one compact JSON object per slot,
# converted from the plain-text prompts of test2.sh. Each is single-quoted so the
# shell leaves it untouched; placeholders are filled by fill_prompt() at queue time.
# NOTE: prompt 9A contains ${MODEL_LABEL} and ${MODEL_COMPANY} in its text_render
#       entries; they are substituted from the environment variables of the same names.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
